                              "rawSource":  "(Extracted from full RTF)",
                              "cleanSource":  "\u0026AuthenticationTypes = GAMRepository.GetEnabledAuthenticationTypes(\u0026Language, \u0026Errors)\n\t\u0026isModeOTP \t\t\t= False\n\tFor \u0026AuthenticationType in \u0026AuthenticationTypes\n\t\tIf \u0026AuthenticationType.Name = \u0026LogOnTo\n\t\t\tDo \"ValidLOgOnToOTP\"\n\t\t\tExit\n\t\tEndif\n\tEndFor\n\tIf \u0026isModeOTP = False\n\t\t\u0026UserPassword.Visible \t\t= True\n\t\t\u0026UserPassword.InviteMessage\t= \"WWP_GAM_Password\"\n\t\tBtnEnter.Caption\t\t\t\t= \"WWP_GAM_SignIn\"\n\t\tForgotPassword.Visible\t\t\t= True\n\t\t\u0026Repository = GAMRepository.Get()\n\t\tDo \u0027DisplayCheckBox\u0027\n\tEndif"
